units metal
atom_style atomic
dimension 3
boundary p p p
newton on
timestep 0.001
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes

lattice fcc 4.05 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region box block 0 1 0 1 0 1 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
replicate 5 5 5

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * /scratch/gilbreth/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt1.potential Al
mass 1 26.9815385

velocity all create 300.0 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
reset_timestep 0
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol lx ly lz
thermo 1000
thermo_modify flush yes

fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1.0
run 10
unfix 1